/.lake

# session scratch
payload*
apply*.py
patch_*.py
fix*.py
run_dyadic*.sh
run_fk_a.sh
run_pikbound.sh
run_prune.sh
prune_*.py
install_payload.py

# regenerable intermediates
# Unanchored so they cover odd-proof/numerics/ too: the rooted forms these
# replaced (numerics/**/...) matched only the unrestricted tree, so the odd
# case's chunk directory and bytecode showed up as untracked.
**/cchunks/
**/ochunks/
# ...except the odd sweep's run of record.  44K, and without it fodd_combine.py
# cannot be run at all: the 335-panel sweep behind fodd75.log takes about an
# hour, so a referee could not reproduce the combine step or the monotonicity
# verdict.  Provenance has been this repository's recurring defect class.
!odd-proof/numerics/ochunks/
!odd-proof/numerics/ochunks/*.txt
**/__pycache__/

# LaTeX build artifacts
paper/*.aux
paper/*.log
paper/*.out
paper/*.toc

# Working notes, kept locally and not published with the repository.
# The repository is cited by the paper; these are development logs rather
# than artifacts a reader of the paper needs.
CLAUDE.md
HANDOFF.md
